        "Content": "Porch - \r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - 4.23m x 2.71m \r\n\r\n\r\nDining Room - 3.82m x 3.9m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.12m x 3.9m \r\n\r\n\r\nSun Room - 3.17m x 5.45m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.05m x 4.39m \r\n\r\n\r\nShower Room - 1.46m x 1.88m \r\n\r\n\r\nStore - \r\n\r\n\r\nGarage - 4.89m x 2.51m \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.37m x 2.09m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.91m x 3.8m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.2m x 3.35m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.76m x 2.54m \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.88m x 2.54m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
